Fri Nov 13 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Caio Bruno <cbrunofb@gmail.com>

- Initial package of mdk4 4.2: source build from the 4.2 git tag (upstream
  tags are not v-prefixed), built with the distro gcc against libnl3 and
  libpcap; ports the CFLAGS workarounds from the fedora-packages sibling
  (gcc>=14 warning guards, tcpdump header defines, LTO/parallel-unsafe ar
  guards); ships the sbin binary and the mdk4(8) manpage.
